  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**BODMAS:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nUsing the BODMAS rule, we solve the given equation for each option:**\n **60 * 19 * 4 * 94 * 42**\n\nOption 1) −,+,=,− \n\n**60 * 19 * 4 * 94 * 42**\n\n 60 - 19 + 4 = 94 - 42\n\n 64 - 19 = 94 - 42\n\n 45 = 52 **Incorrect **\n\nOption 2) −,×,=,+\n\n**60 * 19 * 4 * 94 * 42**\n\n60 - 19 × 4 = 94 + 42\n\n60 - 76 = 94 + 42 \n\n60 - 76 = 136 \n\n-16 = 136 Incorrect \n\nOption 3) +,×,=,+\n\n**60 * 19 * 4 * 94 * 42**\n\n60 + 19 × 4 = 94 + 42\n\n60 + 76 = 94 + 42 \n\n136 = 136 Correct \n\nOption 4) −,+,=,×\n\n**60 * 19 * 4 * 94 * 42**\n\n60 - 19 + 4 = 94 × 42\n\n60 - 19 + 4 = 3948\n\n64 - 19 = 3948\n\n45 = 3948 Incorrect \n\n **Hence **the correct answer is option 3**",
